第 1 条 · 授予的权利 / Section 1 · Grant of Rights
================================================================

1.1 查看与学习：你有权查看、阅读、学习本软件的全部源代码与文档。
1.1 View and Study: You may view, read, and study all of the Software's source code and documentation.

1.2 自用部署：你有权为个人学习或非商业自用目的，在本机下载、安装、部署、运行本软件。
1.2 Personal Deployment: You may download, install, deploy, and run the Software on your own machine for personal learning or non-commercial personal use.

1.3 自用修改：你有权为自用目的修改本软件源码；但修改版仅供你自己使用，**不得对外分发**。
1.3 Personal Modification: You may modify the Software's source code for your own use; however, such modified versions are for your own use only and **must not be distributed**.

前述权利自你首次获取本软件之日起生效，且不收取任何费用。
The foregoing rights take effect on the date you first obtain the Software and are granted free of charge.

