第 2 条 · 限制 / Section 2 · Restrictions
================================================================

2.1 署名与冒名 / Attribution and No Misrepresentation
    不得移除、修改或隐藏本软件中的版权声明、许可声明与作者标识。任何修改版、衍生作品或再分发物，不得以原作者 yushichadao 的名义发布、署名，或声称经其认可、授权、背书。不得将本软件改头换面后以他人名义冒充为原创作品发布。
    You must not remove, modify, or obscure any copyright, license, or authorship notices in the Software. No modified version, derivative work, or redistributable may be published or attributed under the name of the original author yushichadao, nor represented as endorsed, authorized, or approved by them. You may not rebrand the Software and publish it as someone else's original work.

2.2 禁止抄袭 UI / CLI / GUI / No Copying of UI, CLI, or GUI
    不得复制、模仿、改头换面地使用本软件的图形用户界面（GUI）、命令行界面（CLI）及其整体结构、布局、交互流程与视觉设计。你可以学习其设计思路——具体实现与设计须自行完成（一句话：自己写去）。
    You may not copy, imitate, or re-skin the Software's graphical user interface (GUI), command-line interface (CLI), or their overall structure, layout, interaction flows, and visual design. You may learn from its design philosophy—but the concrete implementation and design must be your own (in one phrase: write your own).

2.3 禁止照搬独有代码逻辑 / No Replication of Unique Code Logic
    不得提取、复制或实质性复用本软件特有的实现逻辑、算法、模块架构、数据结构与独特技术方案，用于任何其他软件项目（无论是否署名、无论是否开源）。与本项目无关的、行业通用的常规实现方式，不受此限。
    You may not extract, copy, or substantially reuse the Software's distinctive implementation logic, algorithms, module architecture, data structures, or unique technical solutions for any other software project (whether or not attributed, whether or not open-sourced). General, industry-common implementations unrelated to this project are not restricted.

2.4 再分发 / Redistribution
    本软件默认不鼓励对外再分发。如确需分发修改版或衍生作品，必须：(a) 在显眼位置标注为"基于 AutoChat 的独立修改版"；(b) 遵守 2.1（不得冒名）；(c) 随分发物附上本许可证全文且不得修改。本项目不包含、也不打包分发任何第三方 hook DLL（含闭源方案）；第三方组件遵循其各自许可，由使用者自行获取。
    Redistribution of the Software is not encouraged. If you must redistribute a modified or derivative version, you must: (a) clearly label it as an "independent modification based on AutoChat"; (b) comply with Section 2.1 (no misrepresentation); (c) include this License in full and unmodified. This project does not include or bundle any third-party hook DLL (including closed-source ones); third-party components are governed by their own licenses and obtained by the user.

2.5 违法用途 / No Illegal Use
    本许可证不授权任何违法用途。冒充他人、批量群发、诈骗、骚扰、非法获取或外传他人个人信息等行为，详见 LEGAL.md。使用者因违反禁止用途产生的全部法律责任，由使用者自行承担。
    This License does not authorize any illegal use. Impersonation, mass messaging, fraud, harassment, or the unlawful collection or disclosure of others' personal information are prohibited; see LEGAL.md. Users bear all legal responsibility arising from any violation.

